k-related experience, and prepare you for a successful job search. Learn more about career services a Elms College from J Marshall, Director of Career Services. Career Fair Highlights: Real Connections. Real Outcomes. At Elms, career preparation is part of the experience from day one. See how our students build connections and practice professional skills at our annual Career Fair. ElmsConnect Career Services Meet the Staff “Employers actually seek out Elms College students.” –  J Marshall, Director of Career Services. Did You Know: 100% of education majors are currently employed (class of 2019) 91% of the class of 2024 are employed or continuing their education 90% of our master’s degree graduates are currently employed (class of 2024) Visit Us Hours: Career Services is open Monday through Friday, 8:30am – 4:30pm. Please note that we are closed on holidays aligned with Elms College, some breaks, and occasionally for staff development and training. Directions: Getting to Career Services on the Elms College campus is easy! Our address is: 291 Springfield St. Chicopee, MA 01013 We are located in the Center for Student Success in the Alumnae Library. View Larger Map Share this: Inquire Visit Apply Discover Your Purpose 413-594-2761 291 Springfield Street Chicopee, MA 01013 Stay Connected with Us Social Media Directory Resources 🎓Commencement ▷ Academics Academic Calendar Information Browse by Major/Minor Info Sessions Library Online Continuing Education Programs & Certificates School of Nursing Scholarships The Elms Promise Tuition & Financial Aid ▷ Students & Faculty Center for Student Success Current Students ElmsConnect Faculty & Staff Dashboard Moodle ▷ Institutional Info Accreditation Employment Partnerships Title IX - Request for Information - (for Nursing): Open Form Close Notice Of Nondiscriminatory Policy As To Students Elms College admits students of any race, color, national, and ethnic origin to all the rights, privileges, programs, and activities generally